<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F6F8FD', padding: '56px 72px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0C1222' }}>老板每天问的三个问题，现有工具一个都没回答</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5C6780' }}>不是缺报表，是缺结论和动作</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, padding: '5px 12px', background: '#EEF1FE', border: '1px solid #DDE2F5', borderRadius: 999 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#4C4DDC' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4C4DDC', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1 }}>AI 掌柜</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 3, background: '#4C4DDC', borderRadius: 2, marginTop: 2, marginBottom: 12 }} />
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 300 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8F5', borderRadius: 14, padding: 26, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4C4DDC' }}>01</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0C1222' }}>今天到底赚没赚</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5C6780', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>六张报表翻半小时，只知道跌了，<br />不知道是人少了还是点便宜了。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8F5', borderRadius: 14, padding: 26, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4C4DDC' }}>02</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0C1222' }}>明天该买多少</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5C6780', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>采购靠经验：缺货和压货同时发生，<br />这套数据里 5 种食材只够 2 天。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8F5', borderRadius: 14, padding: 26, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4C4DDC' }}>03</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0C1222' }}>哪道菜在赔钱</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5C6780', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>207 道菜只有 107 道算得清成本，<br />卖得越多，可能亏得越多。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 34, paddingTop: 24, borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8F5', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 28, background: '#4C4DDC', borderRadius: 3 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0C1222' }}>中小餐饮不缺数据，缺一个<Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4C4DDC' }}>能替他做决定</Text>的角色。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 36, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8A93A8' }}>2026 武汉 1024 · 产业应用赛道</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8A93A8' }}>02 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>